  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Carta_ManutencaoPreventivaDeFachadas
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Manuten\xE7\xE3o Preventiva de Fachadas"
  _titleEn: Preventive Facade Maintenance
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Pela teoria das janelas quebradas, de Wilson e Kelling (1982), sinais
    de abandono, como picha\xE7\xE3o e vidros quebrados, estimulam mais desordem
    e pequenos crimes."
  _summaryEn: According to Wilson and Kelling's broken windows theory (1982), signs
    of neglect such as graffiti and broken glass invite more disorder and petty crime.
  _realWorld: Nova York adotou a ideia nos anos 1990; os estudos posteriores mostram
    efeito modesto e discutem quanto da queda do crime veio dela.
  _realWorldEn: New York adopted the idea in the 1990s; later studies show a modest
    effect and debate how much of the drop in crime came from it.
  _tradeOffs: "A evid\xEAncia \xE9 mista, e quando a teoria vira policiamento agressivo
    de pequenas infra\xE7\xF5es gera abusos contra os mais pobres."
  _tradeOffsEn: The evidence is mixed, and when the theory becomes aggressive policing
    of minor offenses it leads to abuses against the poorest.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Teoria das janelas quebradas (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teoria_das_janelas_quebradas
  - Label: Broken windows theory (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Broken_windows_theory
  _relatedEntries:
